’ 산다","partialText":"","date":"2026-05-01T15:49:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/05/02/ODWVFG6ZCNEHBE5HQIX6PFHT74/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"식탁서 만나는 南北… “통일 기다리며 개성 음식 만들죠”","partialText":"","date":"2026-05-01T15:43:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/05/02/ASSRZAAMR5E2XDXXNZ3A5JBREI/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"‘문체 미학의 대가’ 윤후명 작가 1주기… “천진난만 뒤에 서늘한 통찰 지니셨던 분”","partialText":"","date":"2026-05-01T15:43:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/05/02/KZ76WTUHWVGEHIRFELMMJYU3LA/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"한국이 바꿔야 할 경쟁력은? 前 삼성물산 회장이 묻다","partialText":"","date":"2026-05-01T15:42:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/book/2026/05/02/4TGDZVQE5FAHRN6GJHKDLKPYII/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[사진이 있는 도서관] 100년 넘은 시간 견딘… 그 시절 경성 풍경 간직한 건축물 100곳","partialText":"","date":"2026-05-01T15:42:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/book/2026/05/02/P4SDC3LV7FFZHPVURRXPQYXYIE/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["cultur